    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>A Song in Elyel Nalore</strong>, you'll step into the shoes of a skilled protagonist who takes on a simple guild job that turns into a dangerous quest to uncover dark secrets.\u00a0 This Metroidvania-style action adventure combines intense platforming, dynamic combat, and immersive world-building to create an unforgettable journey.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408600/extras/8938e1935087f4c125056797cf04d4a6.poster.avif?t=1750431110\" width=592 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408600/extras/8938e1935087f4c125056797cf04d4a6.webm?t=1750431110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408600/extras/8938e1935087f4c125056797cf04d4a6.mp4?t=1750431110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Discovery:</strong> Dive into a vast, beautifully crafted world where every corner holds hidden secrets.\u00a0 Traverse ancient ruins, dense forests, and mystical caverns as you unlock new areas and discover powerful upgrades.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat System:</strong> Master a fluid and fast-paced combat system, combining swordplay and mystic arts.\u00a0 Use a wide range of abilities to take down terrifying enemies, solve puzzles, and face off against epic bosses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Story:</strong> Unravel a gripping tale of mystery, betrayal, and the consequences of a broken world.\u00a0 The world of Elyel Nalore is rich with lore, where the protagonist's actions will shape the future of this ancient land.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Platforming:</strong> With precision platforming mechanics, your agility will be tested as you leap across crumbling ruins, scale massive cliffs, and navigate treacherous landscapes.\u00a0 Every jump and roll matters in your pursuit of victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Art Beauty:</strong> Immerse yourself in stunning pixel art that brings the world to life with atmospheric environments, beautifully animated characters, and a deep, haunting soundtrack.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Progression:</strong> Enhance your abilities, unlock powerful new skills, and gain strength as you venture deeper into the unknown.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408600/extras/90e10da46b0b4c45a02ba209b228c748.poster.avif?t=1750431110\" width=592 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408600/extras/90e10da46b0b4c45a02ba209b228c748.webm?t=1750431110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408600/extras/90e10da46b0b4c45a02ba209b228c748.mp4?t=1750431110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dark Fantasy World Awaits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land of Elyel Nalore is a place where magic and mystery collide, where ancient gods are whispered about in the dark hours of the night.\u00a0 Will you uncover the truth or will the darkness consume everything you hold dear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Song in Elyel Nalore offers a rich and deep Metroidvania experience that will keep you coming back for more.\u00a0 With every new ability you gain, every area you unlock, and every enemy you defeat, you'll be drawn further into a world that needs saving\u2014and a story that begs to be told.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408600/extras/33eaf7571b0bb269ce8b206baf5a5f0a.poster.avif?t=1750431110\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408600/extras/33eaf7571b0bb269ce8b206baf5a5f0a.webp?t=1750431110\" class=\"bb_img\" width=288 height=128 /></picture></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>A Song in Elyel Nalore</strong>, you'll step into the shoes of a skilled protagonist who takes on a simple guild job that turns into a dangerous quest to uncover dark secrets.\u00a0 This Metroidvania-style action adventure combines intense platforming, dynamic combat, and immersive world-building to create an unforgettable journey.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408600/extras/8938e1935087f4c125056797cf04d4a6.poster.avif?t=1750431110\" width=592 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408600/extras/8938e1935087f4c125056797cf04d4a6.webm?t=1750431110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408600/extras/8938e1935087f4c125056797cf04d4a6.mp4?t=1750431110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Discovery:</strong> Dive into a vast, beautifully crafted world where every corner holds hidden secrets.\u00a0 Traverse ancient ruins, dense forests, and mystical caverns as you unlock new areas and discover powerful upgrades.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat System:</strong> Master a fluid and fast-paced combat system, combining swordplay and mystic arts.\u00a0 Use a wide range of abilities to take down terrifying enemies, solve puzzles, and face off against epic bosses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Story:</strong> Unravel a gripping tale of mystery, betrayal, and the consequences of a broken world.\u00a0 The world of Elyel Nalore is rich with lore, where the protagonist's actions will shape the future of this ancient land.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Platforming:</strong> With precision platforming mechanics, your agility will be tested as you leap across crumbling ruins, scale massive cliffs, and navigate treacherous landscapes.\u00a0 Every jump and roll matters in your pursuit of victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Art Beauty:</strong> Immerse yourself in stunning pixel art that brings the world to life with atmospheric environments, beautifully animated characters, and a deep, haunting soundtrack.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Progression:</strong> Enhance your abilities, unlock powerful new skills, and gain strength as you venture deeper into the unknown.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408600/extras/90e10da46b0b4c45a02ba209b228c748.poster.avif?t=1750431110\" width=592 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408600/extras/90e10da46b0b4c45a02ba209b228c748.webm?t=1750431110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408600/extras/90e10da46b0b4c45a02ba209b228c748.mp4?t=1750431110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dark Fantasy World Awaits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land of Elyel Nalore is a place where magic and mystery collide, where ancient gods are whispered about in the dark hours of the night.\u00a0 Will you uncover the truth or will the darkness consume everything you hold dear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Song in Elyel Nalore offers a rich and deep Metroidvania experience that will keep you coming back for more.\u00a0 With every new ability you gain, every area you unlock, and every enemy you defeat, you'll be drawn further into a world that needs saving\u2014and a story that begs to be told.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408600/extras/33eaf7571b0bb269ce8b206baf5a5f0a.poster.avif?t=1750431110\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408600/extras/33eaf7571b0bb269ce8b206baf5a5f0a.webp?t=1750431110\" class=\"bb_img\" width=288 height=128 /></picture></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
